 odds in this immersive experience.\n\nStrategic Shooting: Stay focused and blast targets coming at you from three tunnels.\n\nUnlockable Rewards: Earn gems to unlock new blasters and level designs.\n\nDual-Wield Fun: Equip blasters in both hands or mix and match to suit your style.\n\nMatch Blast is a must-have for any Quest owner, offering a perfect blend of nostalgia and modern VR action.", "short_description": "Match Blast: A Retro-Inspired VR Shooter\n\nInspired by classic '80s games like Tempest and Asteroids, Match Blast brings a zen-like focus and thrilling gameplay to the VR shooter genre. Strap in and get ready to use your mind and trigger fingers to conquer the odds in this immersive experience."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://johnray32875.wixsite.com/johnraygames/match-blast-privacy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "John Ray", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://johnray32875.wixsite.com/johnraygames", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "3744040075834813"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": ["CASUAL", "PUZZLE", "SHOOTER"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "9036166563067128"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974816_299544178763452_8893538142341751681_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=102&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=y4NGpb_g5Vg